@startuml FileRelicImplementedClasses
title FileRelic — Implemented Class Diagram (current prototype)
hide empty members
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

legend right
  <b>Scope</b>
  This diagram records code that currently exists.
  Packages group free functions; package groups are not C++ classes.
  The GUI currently invokes the CLI as a separate process.
endlegend

package "CLI application (src/main.cpp)" {
  class "main(argc, argv)" as CliMain <<entry point>> {
    +parse command
    +dispatch inspect / demo
  }

  package "Anonymous-namespace inspection functions" as InspectorFunctions {
    class "inspect_image_file(path)" as InspectFile <<free function>>
    class "inspect_mbr(image, size)" as InspectMbr <<free function>>
    class "inspect_extended_partition(...)" as InspectEbr <<free function>>
    class "inspect_gpt(image, size)" as InspectGpt <<free function>>
    class "detect_file_system(...)" as DetectFs <<free function>>
    class "inspect_ext_superblock(...)" as InspectExt <<free function>>
    class "inspect_ext_root_directory(...)" as InspectExtDir <<free function>>
    class "inspect_ext_file_inode(...)" as InspectExtInode <<free function>>
    class "run_demo(executable_path)" as RunDemo <<free function>>
  }

  class MbrEntry <<struct>> {
    +type: unsigned char
    +start_sector: uint32
    +sector_count: uint32
  }

  class GptHeader <<struct>> {
    +header_size: uint32
    +current_lba: uint64
    +backup_lba: uint64
    +first_usable_lba: uint64
    +last_usable_lba: uint64
    +partition_entries_lba: uint64
    +partition_entry_count: uint32
    +partition_entry_size: uint32
    +partition_entries_crc32: uint32
  }

  class ExtSuperblockInfo <<struct>> {
    +block_size: uint32
    +inode_size: uint16
    +inodes_per_group: uint32
  }
}

package "Shared inspection API (src/image_inspector.h)" {
  class InspectionReport <<struct>> {
    +image_path: filesystem::path
    +image_size_bytes: uintmax_t
    +exit_code: int
    +rendered_text: string
    +succeeded(): bool
  }
  class "inspect_image(path)" as InspectApi <<function>>
  class "render_report(report, output)" as RenderApi <<function>>
}

package "Qt desktop application (gui/)" {
  class MainWindow <<Qt class>> {
    +chooseImage()
    +analyzeImage()
    +appendOutput()
    +inspectionFinished(...)
    +toggleRawLog(visible)
    -cliPath(): QString
    -inspectImage(path)
    -renderResults(succeeded)
    -clearResults()
    -addResultCard(...)
    -selectedImagePath: QString
    -rawReport: QString
  }
  class QProcess <<Qt class>>
  class "Qt Widgets" as QtWidgets <<framework>>
}

CliMain ..> InspectApi : calls for inspect
CliMain ..> RunDemo : calls for demo
InspectApi ..> InspectFile : captures parser output
InspectApi ..> InspectionReport : creates
RenderApi ..> InspectionReport : reads
InspectFile ..> InspectMbr : scans partition table
InspectMbr ..> MbrEntry : decodes entries
InspectMbr ..> InspectEbr : follows extended partitions
InspectMbr ..> InspectGpt : follows protective MBR
InspectMbr ..> DetectFs : checks partition signatures
InspectEbr ..> DetectFs : checks logical partitions
InspectGpt ..> DetectFs : checks GPT partitions
DetectFs ..> InspectExt : on ext-family signature
InspectExt ..> ExtSuperblockInfo : constructs
InspectExt ..> InspectExtDir : reads root metadata
InspectExtDir ..> InspectExtInode : reads named inode
MainWindow ..> QProcess : starts filerelic inspect-image
MainWindow ..> QtWidgets : builds result cards
QProcess ..> CliMain : launches CLI executable

note bottom of MainWindow
  GUI currently displays structured-looking cards by interpreting
  CLI report text. It does not yet call InspectionReport directly.
end note

note bottom of InspectionReport
  Current report carries rendered text, not typed partition objects.
end note

@enduml
